st play to prevent the landlord from winning. Playing ♥J applies maximum pressure - if the landlord cannot beat it, I control the next turn and can play my ♥9 to win. Passing would be catastrophic as it gives control to the landlord who could potentially win.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥J"]}'}
